  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（千雪……すごいぞ、最高だった……！\r\nはやく声をかけたいけど、どこへ行ったんだ……？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ファンA",
    "text": "おい、千雪ちゃんが出口で挨拶してるってよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ファンB",
    "text": "えっ、マジで！？\r\nお、俺も行く！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え、千雪……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ありがとうございました～！\r\nふふ、またお目にかかれますように～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "016",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040140",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040150,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "わあ、お花……！\r\nありがとうございます～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あ、千雪……あんなところに……！\r\nファンへのサービスってことか……？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（いや、さ、最後だからってことかな……\r\nでも、このままじゃ運営に怒られちゃうぞ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ち、千雪ー！\r\nちょっと待っ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ステージ主催者",
    "text": "あ、千雪ちゃーん、お疲れ\r\n今日よかったよー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あれは……主催のプロデューサー？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ステージ主催者",
    "text": "千雪ちゃん、マジでさ、今度お願いねー\r\n事務所の方、連絡入れとくからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040160,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "わぁ、本当ですか？\r\nとっても嬉しいです～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ステージ主催者",
    "text": "いやー、その笑顔を見れただけでさ、\r\n今日のイベントやった価値があったよ。じゃ頑張って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040170,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ありがとうございます！\r\nお疲れさまでしたー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ち、千雪、今の……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040180,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサーさん、おつかれさまです\r\n吉報ですよ～",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040190,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私、ステージのお仕事もらっちゃいましたー♪",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、ええ？　あの……\r\nアイドル……続けてくれるのか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040200,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あ……そのお話がまだでしたね\r\nちゃんと、後でお伝えしようと思っていたんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040210,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私、お店を退職して、\r\nこれからはアイドルとして、しっかり頑張っていきます",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、ええ！　本当か！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040220,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふ、はい♪　\r\nそれで、挨拶まわりとファンの方々のお見送りをしてたんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040230,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "挨拶は、プロデューサーさんに教えていただいた\r\n基本、ですから",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ち、千雪……！\r\nでも……雑貨は、本当にいいのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040240,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私、誰かに笑顔になってもらえるかぎり、\r\n雑貨づくりはやめません",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040250,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "これからは、自分と、アルストロメリアのみんなと、\r\nそれからファンの方々に喜んでもらえる雑貨を作りたいです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040260,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、\r\n応援……してくださいますか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040260"
  },
