    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪がそうしたいって、思ったんだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040270,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい\r\n今回のことで気がついたんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001040280,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私は、自分が思っていた以上に\r\nアイドルも雑貨も、大好きなんだって……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600104/1016001040280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、すごく……いい顔をしてるな\r\nやっぱり、千雪の笑顔は最高だよ",
